{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/4f38f41ac248722855f950693afd0ceb.avif?t=1752876659\" data-has-big width=800 height=277 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game where the power of stories shapes reality, driven by unique intelligent narrative system...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapted from Persian folklore: The brutal and bloodthirsty King Shahryar, consumed by rage after his wife's betrayal, takes a new bride each day only to cruelly execute her at dawn. You are Scheherazade, his next victim...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you end his reign of terror by literally telling stories? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/c2bd3170752aebdc186a103b36f3c9b1.avif?t=1752876659\" data-has-big width=800 height=103 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/7cc6940fd4ca85b5e65195f5d52d3aca.poster.avif?t=1752876659\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/7cc6940fd4ca85b5e65195f5d52d3aca.webm?t=1752876659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/7cc6940fd4ca85b5e65195f5d52d3aca.mp4?t=1752876659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Inspired by Wittgenstein's notion: &quot;The limits of my language mean the limits of my world.&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your imagination! Tell captivating tales to intrigue the merciless King through typing. Cleverly guide him to mention words like 'sword', 'knife', or 'shield' in his responses - watch as they magically materialize into real weapons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brought to life by our unique intelligent narrative system, each story is a one-of-a-kind creation - completely unscripted! But beware... strange words might provoke the King's deadly wrath...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/093c4eda13e472d4e0fe52f65f535130.avif?t=1752876659\" data-has-big width=800 height=103 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/6e4a8fb81c71784202ba4adcad6ffeed.poster.avif?t=1752876659\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/6e4a8fb81c71784202ba4adcad6ffeed.webm?t=1752876659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/6e4a8fb81c71784202ba4adcad6ffeed.mp4?t=1752876659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect weapons forged from your stories! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Generated in real-time based on your narratives! From shawarma kitchen knives to witch's spears... every weapon is one of a kind!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/7487dbd548166887e04aefc0ec8facf8.avif?t=1752876659\" data-has-big width=800 height=103 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/69a4bb1a68dec5ad6cb61c9950575070.poster.avif?t=1752876659\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/69a4bb1a68dec5ad6cb61c9950575070.webm?t=1752876659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/69a4bb1a68dec5ad6cb61c9950575070.mp4?t=1752876659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battle the King in a world born from your tales! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each battle is an unprecedented theatrical performance - weapon effects and even character dialogues spring from the stories you've crafted!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-Crafting Game:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powered by innovative storytelling mechanics as the core gameplay. This unique experience combines creative writing with strategic gameplay. Award-winning design ensures every story is unique!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixel Art Aesthetics:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features distinctive pixel art and hand-drawn illustrations! All artwork is lovingly created by human artists to bring your stories to life.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge Traditional Norms:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break free from ancient patriarchal constraints with Scheherazade!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Academic Foundation:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than just a game - it's an academic and artistic project. We've published two papers on the game's systems, hoping to inspire more novel games!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2542850?t=1752876659","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2542850?t=1752876659","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752876659","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752876659","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2782660,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Find us!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/7c590b3571f8f80a976201c12bb95ed7.avif?t=1752876659\" width=762 height=142 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>X </strong>@AdaEden1001 |\u00a0<strong>Tiktok &amp; IG</strong>\u00a0@1001nights.ai</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our <strong>Discord</strong> through the right sidebar!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/4f38f41ac248722855f950693afd0ceb.avif?t=1752876659\" data-has-big width=800 height=277 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game where the power of stories shapes reality, driven by unique intelligent narrative system...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapted from Persian folklore: The brutal and bloodthirsty King Shahryar, consumed by rage after his wife's betrayal, takes a new bride each day only to cruelly execute her at dawn. You are Scheherazade, his next victim...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you end his reign of terror by literally telling stories? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/c2bd3170752aebdc186a103b36f3c9b1.avif?t=1752876659\" data-has-big width=800 height=103 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/7cc6940fd4ca85b5e65195f5d52d3aca.poster.avif?t=1752876659\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/7cc6940fd4ca85b5e65195f5d52d3aca.webm?t=1752876659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/7cc6940fd4ca85b5e65195f5d52d3aca.mp4?t=1752876659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Inspired by Wittgenstein's notion: &quot;The limits of my language mean the limits of my world.&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your imagination! Tell captivating tales to intrigue the merciless King through typing. Cleverly guide him to mention words like 'sword', 'knife', or 'shield' in his responses - watch as they magically materialize into real weapons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brought to life by our unique intelligent narrative system, each story is a one-of-a-kind creation - completely unscripted! But beware... strange words might provoke the King's deadly wrath...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/093c4eda13e472d4e0fe52f65f535130.avif?t=1752876659\" data-has-big width=800 height=103 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/6e4a8fb81c71784202ba4adcad6ffeed.poster.avif?t=1752876659\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/6e4a8fb81c71784202ba4adcad6ffeed.webm?t=1752876659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/6e4a8fb81c71784202ba4adcad6ffeed.mp4?t=1752876659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect weapons forged from your stories! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Generated in real-time based on your narratives! From shawarma kitchen knives to witch's spears... every weapon is one of a kind!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/7487dbd548166887e04aefc0ec8facf8.avif?t=1752876659\" data-has-big width=800 height=103 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/69a4bb1a68dec5ad6cb61c9950575070.poster.avif?t=1752876659\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/69a4bb1a68dec5ad6cb61c9950575070.webm?t=1752876659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/69a4bb1a68dec5ad6cb61c9950575070.mp4?t=1752876659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battle the King in a world born from your tales! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each battle is an unprecedented theatrical performance - weapon effects and even character dialogues spring from the stories you've crafted!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-Crafting Game:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powered by innovative storytelling mechanics as the core gameplay. This unique experience combines creative writing with strategic gameplay. Award-winning design ensures every story is unique!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixel Art Aesthetics:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features distinctive pixel art and hand-drawn illustrations! All artwork is lovingly created by human artists to bring your stories to life.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge Traditional Norms:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break free from ancient patriarchal constraints with Scheherazade!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Academic Foundation:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than just a game - it's an academic and artistic project. We've published two papers on the game's systems, hoping to inspire more novel games!</p></li></ul>","developers":["Ada Eden"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/header.jpg?t=1752876659","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.12+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel or AMD Dual Core at 2 GHz or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel Graphics 4400 or better<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2542850/7