","required_age":"14","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt\nAlkohol / Tabak\nDerbe Sprache","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"To be announced"},"required_age":0,"reviews":"\u201cThe concept is so great, I was amazed of how well it worked! That games power is endless.\u201d<br>AMaze Award<br><br>\u201cPresents a unique and groundbreaking concept by combining technology to enable real-time co-creative storytelling.\u201d<br>SIGGRAPH Asia<br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/03d6c34e5c5894df4481fa32c831d552acedec80/ss_03d6c34e5c5894df4481fa32c831d552acedec80.1920x1080.jpg?t=1752876659","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/03d6c34e5c5894df4481fa32c831d552acedec80/ss_03d6c34e5c5894df4481fa32c831d552acedec80.600x338.jpg?t=1752876659"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/ss_08437899986884a8e203a2f5b4e944535876f729.1920x1080.jpg?t=1752876659","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/ss_08437899986884a8e203a2f5b4e944535876f729.600x338.jpg?t=1752876659"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/ss_e79f94df96e98e3a47cf3ecad1d3e08867a8e7c4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1752876659","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/ss_e79f94df96e98e3a47cf3ecad1d3e08867a8e7c4.600x338.jpg?t=1752876659"},{"id":3,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/11d24599949dc454fd1847ed933fc6bad5ec18ab/ss_11d24599949dc454fd1847ed933fc6bad5ec18ab.1920x1080.jpg?t=1752876659","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/11d24599949dc454fd1847ed933fc6bad5ec18ab/ss_11d24599949dc454fd1847ed933fc6bad5ec18ab.600x338.jpg?t=1752876659"},{"id":4,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/ss_d60cef4ffc57ecd68b5172deb02128125c33bc06.1920x1080.jpg?t=1752876659","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/ss_d60cef4ffc57ecd68b5172deb02128125c33bc06.600x338.jpg?t=1752876659"},{"id":5,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/ss_1159d64d465df1119535ec9597a5e676ed8af478.1920x1080.jpg?t=1752876659","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/ss_1159d64d465df1119535ec9597a5e676ed8af478.600x338.jpg?t=1752876659"},{"id":6,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/ss_dd77dec54fe6cce6eb5b03b955fa2ca0c8380ea5.1920x1080.jpg?t=1752876659","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/ss_dd77dec54fe6cce6eb5b03b955fa2ca0c8380ea5.600x338.jpg?t=1752876659"},{"id":7,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/ss_a8e9f0e41b14d68102aa734cb610de5d6af1d974.1920x1080.jpg?t=1752876659","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/ss_a8e9f0e41b14d68102aa734cb610de5d6af1d974.600x338.jpg?t=1752876659"},{"id":8,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/ss_2c444e01af0e7efe083a53568dbd4400597aeb21.1920x1080.jpg?t=1752876659","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/ss_2c444e01af0e7efe083a53568dbd4400597aeb21.600x338.jpg?t=1752876659"},{"id":9,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/ss_5a99a58d097c170430132efa5490548abb150621.1920x1080.jpg?t=1752876659","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/ss_5a99a58d097c170430132efa5490548abb150621.600x338.jpg?t=1752876659"},{"id":10,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/3aae29fc7f1db04fd6b69e2a6facdec23b437430/ss_3aae29fc7f1db04fd6b69e2a6facdec23b437430.1920x1080.jpg?t=1752876659","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/3aae29fc7f1db04fd6b69e2a6facdec23b437430/ss_3aae29fc7f1db04fd6b69e2a6facdec23b437430.600x338.jpg?t=1752876659"}],"short_description":"Can you survive an evil King who kills a bride every night by telling stories? A story-crafting game based on a unique narrative system \u2014 Become the storyteller Scheherazade from Persian folklore, weave tales to the King through typing, and guide his words to forge magical weapons for your revenge!","steam_appid":2542850,"support_info":{"email":"adaeden1001@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, Simplified Chinese","type":"game","website":"https://www.1001nights.ai/"}